`verilator_config
// CircuitLoop lint policy (applied to every lint and simulation build).
//
// PROCASSINIT: Xilinx 7-series flip-flops are loaded from their declaration
// initializer (INIT attribute) by GSR at configuration time, so
// `reg q = 1'b0;` is the intended power-on-value idiom on the Basys 3.
// Every other -Wall warning stays enabled and is reported.
lint_off -rule PROCASSINIT
